# Cloudflare Pages redirects. One rule per line: <from> <to> <status>
#
# /delete-account was the original path of the account-deletion page. It moved
# to /account-deletion in db86f25 (2026-08-10) and the old path was left to
# 404 — but that old URL is what the Google Play Data safety form declares as
# the account-deletion URL, and Play requires it to work. Keep this rule for as
# long as any store console, printed material or old email can still point at
# the old path.
/delete-account  /account-deletion  301
